abstract: >-
  OpenLain5G is a reproducible research environment for deploying, managing,
  and validating software 4G LTE and 5G SA data networks plus guarded X-Series
  USRP laboratory workflows. It integrates existing open-source components with
  configuration, orchestration, validation, run traceability, RF safeguards,
  and a FastAPI/React interface.
repository-code: "https://github.com/guallycanazas/Lain5G"
url: "https://github.com/guallycanazas/Lain5G"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - "4G LTE"
  - "5G SA"
  - "Open5GS"
  - "UERANSIM"
  - "USRP"
  - "network experimentation"
  - "reproducibility"
